# Cyrano-Task-Manager — always

You are in **Cyrano-Task-Manager**, an internal task tool with its own repo
and its own database.

Read `AGENTS.md` and `PROJECT-MEMORY.md` before changing behavior.

- Do not import or point this app at Cyrano AI Tools, CyranoAPP-Design, or
  CyranoApp-AI-Production databases or code at runtime. Ports only.
- Every user action is a command + Zod contract.
- All data access goes through `lib/data/`; RLS on every table in the
  creating migration; anon key only in the browser.
- Shareable view state lives in the URL.
- Mutations are visible, undoable runs; deletes are soft.
- No `any`, no god files, no new deps without approval + THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.
- One glossary: it is a Task, not a todo/item/ticket/card.
- No PHI, customer-confidential content, or secrets in tasks (COMPLIANCE.md).
- If you invent a pattern, update FEATURE-PLAYBOOK in the same PR.
- Standard/Comprehensive work: bolt plan, then wait for a human yes
  (FEATURE-PLAYBOOK §3).
